From bb486a1f679a1324ff18a59bceceacf37bbd05e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Avinash M N <avimn@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Apr 2017 08:57:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 095/104] drm/amdgpu: Revert page table updating using CPU

ROCm1.5 does not incorporate the code to update page tables using CPU.
This patch also cleans up some irrelevant code related to page table update

Signed-off-by: Avinash M N <avimn@amd.com>
