 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.c           | 314 +----------------------
 drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/amdgpu_vm.h           |  15 --
 5 files changed, 1 insertion(+), 342 deletions(-)

